OL,3,AMicrosoft posts $36.6bn profit after
OL,4,Aoffering buyouts to one in four workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTechnology giant Microsoft says its
OL,7,Fprofits for the three months to the end
OL,8,Fof September jumped to more than
OL,9,F$36.6bn (#27.5bn), just days after
OL,10,Fannouncing plans to cut its workforce
OL,11,Fby more than a quarter.
OL,13,FOn Monday, the Windows developer said
OL,14,Fit would offer voluntary buyouts to
OL,15,Faround 60,000 of its workers to cut
OL,16,Fcosts as it pours billions of dollars
OL,17,Finto artificial intelligence (AI).
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
