OL,3,ADetails of thousands of US immigration
OL,4,Aagents leaked in major hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetails of more than 41,000 personnel
OL,7,Fworking for the US Department of
OL,8,FHomeland Security (DHS), including
OL,9,Fthousands involved in immigration
OL,10,Fenforcement, have been leaked to the
OL,11,Fpublic.
OL,13,FThe leak includes names, work addresses
OL,14,Fand phone numbers of DHS staff,
OL,15,Fincluding agents working with
OL,16,FImmigration and Customs Enforcement
OL,17,F(ICE) and Customs and Border
OL,18,FProtection, along with descriptions of
OL,19,Fthe work they do for each agency.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
